WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.119 --> 00:00:01.280
Halle, I understand there was

2
00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.139
a bit of romance for you, you fell in love on the set.

3
00:00:03.139 --> 00:00:04.222
Is that true?

4
00:00:06.353 --> 00:00:07.186
(whooping)

5
00:00:07.186 --> 00:00:09.019
I did.
That's what I heard.

6
00:00:09.019 --> 00:00:10.486
There was a rumor that you fell in love on the set.

7
00:00:10.486 --> 00:00:12.628
I did, but my castmates don't know about it.

8
00:00:12.628 --> 00:00:13.854
Why you gotta bust me out.

9
00:00:13.854 --> 00:00:15.437
That's my job.

10
00:00:15.437 --> 00:00:16.484
Who told you that?
First of all,

11
00:00:16.484 --> 00:00:18.352
I don't know what bust me out means, second,

12
00:00:18.352 --> 00:00:20.610
(audience laughs)

13
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:22.730
the reason I'm busting you out

14
00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:25.021
is 'cause that's my job to reveal interesting information.

15
00:00:25.021 --> 00:00:27.104
I did, there was a boy,

16
00:00:30.656 --> 00:00:34.532
yeah, there was a boy.
(audience cheers)

17
00:00:34.532 --> 00:00:38.123
I guess the reason I liked him is that he was very quiet.

18
00:00:38.123 --> 00:00:41.803
He did whatever I said, let me have my way.

19
00:00:41.803 --> 00:00:42.673
Perfect, perfect,
These are the things

20
00:00:42.673 --> 00:00:43.940
you like, I think we have-
Perfect guy.

21
00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:45.740
We have a photograph here.
His name's Charlie.

22
00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:48.519
[Conan] There we go.
[Audience] Awe.

23
00:00:48.519 --> 00:00:49.991
[Conan] You really bonded with this horse, didn't you?

24
00:00:49.991 --> 00:00:51.810
[Halle] I bonded with Charlie, yeah, I did.

25
00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:52.930
So, people forever have been tryin'

26
00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:54.839
to figure out how to make you love them,

27
00:00:54.839 --> 00:00:56.290
and they just needed to act like a horse?

28
00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:59.119
(laughing)

29
00:00:59.119 --> 00:01:00.702
That's it?

30
00:01:00.702 --> 00:01:03.535
That's as simple as it is?
Yeah.

